{"blocks":[{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2017/03/18/2559194/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"昨日はミュージックステーションにて"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"インフルエンサー初披露でした！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"衣装の色はこの3色に加えてグリーンもあるよ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ワッペンはよく見るとNと刺繍してあるの〜"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2017/03/18/2559194/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"『伊藤まりかっと。』予告編公開してます！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"https://youtu.be/k11r8hetTWU"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"装苑のトークイベントですでに"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"フルバージョンを公開いましたが、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今回の特典映像は個人PVです。わーい"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"監督は2ndのデート前日の気持ち、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"5thの1カット！以来の福島真希さん。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"音楽→福島節さん"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"振付→菅尾なぎささん"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まりっかをつくってくれた"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"スタッフの皆さんと三度目の制作です。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"17歳と21歳では吸う空気が全然違くて、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ちゃんと変われてるなと思えたけど、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"変に大人ぶらなくていいな"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そのままでありたいなとも思ったし、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"年齢を重ねてもこの世界観を"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いろんなかたちで表現していきたい"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"と思いました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"21歳の大切な記録であります。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ライブでいちばん盛り上がる曲(設定)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"なので()内はコールすると面白いだよ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2017/03/18/2559194/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"初回限定版ジャケット"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"(Type-Cに収録されています)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今回のシングルは"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"マジで踊ってる表題とcwに加えて"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"底抜けに明るい個人PVで"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まったく異なる自分がいて"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"その違いを自分でも楽しめたので"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みなさんもぜひ楽しんで見てくだせい！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2017/03/18/2559194/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2017/03/18/2559194/0004.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"隅から隅まで愛情たっぷりだ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"撮影秘話は次号のMdN連載で"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"詳しく話しました！おたのしみにヽ(ﾟ､｡)ﾉ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"期間限定でフルバージョン公開中"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ありがてえーーー！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"https://youtu.be/m7m0f7e7Llk"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まりか"}],"source":"archive"}